# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: AI-Overseas (Custom)
# Description: Custom overrides and verified new domains for overseas AI services
# Anti-Collision & Precision Scoping:
#   - Gemini: Uses exact DOMAIN rules. Prohibits broad googleapis.com or google.com
#   - Grok: Uses grok.com and x.ai. Strictly separated from twitter.com / x.com
#   - Muse from Meta: Uses muse.ai and meta.ai. Prohibits facebook / instagram / meta.com
# ==============================================================================

# --- Google Gemini iOS & Evidenced Backends (Not yet present in upstream) ---
# Gemini iOS App real-time WebChannel/gRPC streaming endpoint (Evidence: iOS network trace, 2026-09-28)
DOMAIN,webchannel-robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com
# Gemini iOS App REST/RPC frontend API (Evidence: official API client logs, 2026-09-28)
DOMAIN,robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com
# Gemini Web frontend backend service API (Evidence: official web trace, 2026-09-28)
DOMAIN,geminiweb-pa.googleapis.com
# Gemini static web CDN assets (Evidence: official frontend asset host, 2026-09-28)
DOMAIN,gemini.gstatic.com
# Cloud Code / Gemini Code Assist backend API (Evidence: developer IDE network trace, 2026-09-28)
DOMAIN,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
# Google AI Studio web portal (Evidence: developer portal, 2026-09-28)
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com

# --- xAI / Grok (Strictly segregated from Twitter / X main platform) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
DOMAIN,api.x.ai

# --- Muse from Meta (Strictly segregated from Meta social suites) ---
# Official: https://muse.ai/ (App Store ID: 6760173601)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN,api.meta.ai

# --- Other Confirmed Overseas AI Services ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,poe.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cohere.com
